// A harness script (`net::harness::Script`) for the dedicated server: a flat patch on the shipped
// heightmap, centre x=680 z=-520 (MEASURED from `terrain_height.png`: 4 cm relief over the ±10 m
// square about it, 7 cm with lane 1's square at +8 m x, no map object within 45 m); the server
// sets each tank's height as every spawn does (`terrain_grid::spawn_pos`); identity rotation. The
// lane spawn's default sits at the world origin, a slope the tanks slide apart on; lane 1 lands
// 8 m along +x from lane 0. Fixture data of the shot and pen cam runners (`scripts/shot/`,
// `scripts/perf/run-pencam-cost.sh`), not of any tank.
(
    spawn_pose: (at: (680.0, -520.0), rot: (0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0)),
)
